All-languages view (python and `_osr` included): src 196,664, tests 205,463, plus witness 4,084 and fixture 2,237; reads ~1.05. No variant I tried gives 1.66; the nearest is comment-stripped source against raw test lines (1.81). ''Where 1.66 came from: testimony.''

Other counts:
* `it(`/`test(` rows: 12,659 across `packages/*/tests`, `tests`, `tools` (rg, line-start; `.each` counts once, so a floor).
* Test files: median 80 non-comment lines, p90 223, 100 over 300, 29 over 500. Half of all test LOC sits in 365 of 1,819 files.
* Source: half of source LOC sits in 178 of 1,165 files; 22 TS files exceed 1,000 raw lines, 6 exceed 1,500.
